{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":374090,\"title\":\"The Sea Is Blue\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A stop motion fable explains how the ocean got its color.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vq1DMuXVmWXXgxNYwnh6Hvt9vJC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dzwK8gbCeyB4sqwORcCDU38SPG0.jpg\",\"rating\":3.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2015,\"runtime\":8,\"genres\":[\"Animation\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Vincent Peone\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1448858,\"name\":\"Vincent Peone\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hVIyni491raNFjnWG6s4T2wgSFc.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":14447,\"title\":\"A Matter of Loaf and Death\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x4b1HN2TOyMQV6NF1YPea6KgnDs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3POPDr2laIl63y9gjJJQOAwgRl9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Wallace and Gromit open a bakery, accidentally getting tied up with a murder mystery in the process. But when Wallace falls in love, Gromit is left to solve the case by himself.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":124277,\"title\":\"The Maker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4geL2tHSHECuG0WjHYMxaUidiWa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cTmtlMffomDOlIMe4CqqjZqH5K7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A strange creature races against time to make the most important and beautiful creation of his life.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Music\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":461303,\"title\":\"Negative Space\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kzC44MFxDP9J5sfAmbtL5SDWLCh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c0hnZoHFxOBgv962ku4PPVJ9Qjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Even though Sam's father is hardly ever home because he is often away on business trips, he is able to connect with his son by teaching him how to pack a suitcase.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446370,\"title\":\"Hi Stranger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lXMydNXO2IeZlkkolqNfmwJDRVH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t8hYaY0ZCX0ukmE9NGjOsmtt2K.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"I made this film especially for you. I needed to check in with you. I needed to tell you how I feel.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270151,\"title\":\"Solar Beats\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2KFym7sBD1r6DQ8c2WC9dmRCjfx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6A2SpgqMIfyGnJLskL6zS1IUccx.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Walking towards the fire. In a ceaseless stream of light, people, landscapes and objects lead us to mysterious regions. French filmmaker Patrick Bokanowski’s work is hard to classify - and all the richer for it. Together with his wife Michèle, whose musique concrète compositions form the basis of the sound design, Bokanowski offers a prolonged, dense and visually visceral experience of the kind that is rare in cinema today. Difficult to define and locate, its strangeness is quite unique.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270153,\"title\":\"Éclats d'Orphée\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4krtAx8lsowHogDMH2pNLHqpdVh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1HzKbZkAmCJiLPmkNdN0s7Pkwhi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Film directed from the play \\\"Orpheon\\\", directed by François Tanguy, played by the Compagny of Raft.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645757,\"title\":\"That Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uR3uhztTAxGGK7Co0yyxVy4Gc7H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1rpyQcniNIJgsE0wKLOqPk2n7b7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's an unforgettable Christmas for the townsfolk of Wellington-on-Sea when the worst snowstorm in history alters everyone's plans — including Santa's.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":920,\"title\":\"Cars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Touk3m5gzsqr1VsvxypdyHY5ci.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sd4xN5xi8tKRPrJOWwNiZEile7f.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lightning McQueen, a hotshot rookie race car driven to succeed, discovers that life is about the journey, not the finish line, when he finds himself unexpectedly detoured in the sleepy Route 66 town of Radiator Springs. On route across the country to the big Piston Cup Championship in California to compete against two seasoned pros, McQueen gets to know the town's offbeat characters.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":810,\"title\":\"Shrek the Third\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4SexGGQzI26E269tfpa80MZaGV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvXxKpFGXvQJRB0nvvfURhRD3C0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the King of Far Far Away dies, Shrek and Fiona are to succede. However, Shrek wants to return to his cozy swamp and live in peace and quiet, so when he finds out there is another heir to the throne, he and Donkey set off to bring him back to rule the kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1234097,\"title\":\"Tapir Memories\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Cs6B3ZlF2TiCNhe8HnblYh0IfC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A tapir mother reveals her tragic story in an embroidery. She suffers a violent attack, the loss of her home, and the disappearance of her son. Will she find him?\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1436188,\"title\":\"Dilution\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qwCOC25ZMKU6VVN6YKeKqYe7qN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dA8cak76khNuZM2o4XX1Dxez1Wv.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dilution is an experimental short film that explores the transit between resistance and (di)ssolution, between holding and releasing and a path towards obsessive repetition. They are layers, exposed pores, matter that oscillates between remaining or disappearing. The sound is not a background, but a puncture: friction, tearing, water that drags what still persists. A sensorial testimony of what refuses to vanish completely.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"2EF4zsGNC9s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"koRvRsflL4Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"K-H35Mpj4uk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}